t of view. Moreover, we provide examples of questions and tasks that could be used by teachers to spur meaningful student activity in this era of AI availability. As NCTM (2024) stated, \"educators need to be involved in developing and testing AI tools in math education to stay up to date with current AI trends to best prepare students for an AI future\" (para.",
