pment of soft skills in VR, discussing challenges in accuracy, biases, and ethical considerations. Chheang et al. [11] conducted a pilot study to examine the effectiveness of a ChatGPT-powered embodied virtual assistant in anatomy education, revealing the significant impact of the chatbot avatar configuration.",
