plications for educational applications outside of the typical classroom setting and in student-teacher interactions. The results of a comparable systematic review of AI research conducted from 2007 to 2018 [15] showed a lack of critical examination of the risks and ethical implications of artificial intelligence (AI) for interactions between students and teachers.",
