itate students' scientific inquiry, supporting them to be Pragmatic Innovators, Foundational Explorers, and Holistic Visionaries when appropriately used with adaptive pedagogical strategies [9]. \n\nLikewise, since the release of ChatGPT in November 2022 ignited interest in the educational potential of LLMs [10], the majority of related studies, as of August 2023, have been predominantly visionary and presumable.",
